# Base44

> Base44 is an AI-powered app builder that lets anyone turn ideas into fully functional web apps using natural language (vibe coding) — no code, no external infrastructure required. The platform generates UI, backend logic, database schemas, authentication, file storage, and APIs automatically. It is suited for founders, product managers, and small teams building MVPs, internal tools, customer portals, and lightweight SaaS products.

Apps are hosted on Base44's infrastructure with custom domain support, built-in analytics, and one-click publishing. Users can sync their codebase to GitHub for local development and external tooling.

## Core product

- [App builder](https://app.base44.com/): The Base44 builder interface where apps and superagents are created, edited, and published using natural language prompts.
- [Home](https://base44.com/): Platform overview and entry point to the builder, including prompt examples and feature highlights.
- [Features](https://base44.com/features): Full feature list covering AI builder chat, database management, authentication, storage, email, payments (Stripe), auto-generated APIs, workflow automation, version control, real-time collaboration, analytics, custom domains, and responsive design.
- [Base44 for Developers](https://base44.com/developers): Deploy anything directly from your IDE or AI agent. Full-stack apps with database, auth, realtime, integrations, and hosting built in, with a CLI and SDK optimized for AI coding agents like Claude Code and Cursor.
- [Superagents](https://base44.com/superagents): AI agents that connect to external tools (email, calendar, CRM, etc.) and run autonomously, configurable in minutes without code.
- [Integrations](https://base44.com/integrations): Overview of built-in and third-party integrations.
- [Templates Marketplace](https://base44.com/templates): Community-built app templates that users can clone and customize.
- [AI App Builder](https://base44.com/ai-app-builder): Covers how Base44 turns a text prompt into a working app — UI, backend, authentication, and data storage included. Explains the 5-step build process, security scanning, SSO, role-based access controls, and available integrations. Includes a template library, use-case examples by category, and FAQs on no-code app creation.
- [AI Website Builder](https://base44.com/ai-website-builder): Covers how Base44 generates a complete website from a single prompt, with built-in hosting, a free Base44 domain, backend infrastructure, and security scanning. Explains the 5-step creation process, private deployments, SCIM provisioning, and integrations (Stripe, HubSpot, Google Drive). Includes FAQs on AI website creation and vibe coding.

