## Pricing and plans

- [Pricing](https://base44.com/pricing): Tiered plans including a free tier; paid plans from $16/mo billed annually. Credits power AI generation — each prompt, edit, or build action consumes credits. GitHub integration available on Builder plan and above.
- [Enterprise](https://base44.com/enterprise): Enterprise plan covering SSO, granular permissions, centralized user management, private hosting, and advanced support.

